#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:9
#: 5123b239e96e4cd382d018e56f537c6a
msgid ""
"This article shows how to setup the `SkySight MONO "
"<http://skysight.eu/?product=skysight-mono>`__ to trigger pictures on "
"cameras equipped with the Sony MultiPort™ connector"
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何设置 `SkySight MONO <http://skysight.eu/?product=skysight-mono>`__ 以触发配备"
" Sony MultiPort™ 接口的相机拍照"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:14
#: 1542d24aa4b64467b6bb80238a014f1e
msgid ""
"`SkySightMONO <http://skysight.eu/?product=skysight-mono>`__ and CameraCable"
msgstr "`SkySightMONO <http://skysight.eu/?product=skysight-mono>`__ 及相机数据线"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:17
#: a1e07c50a51b43b7bd88b69e70ad87d1
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:19
#: f889f224d0c348dcaf5eabc6d1733938
msgid ""
"ArduPilot allows you to :ref:`configure a servo or relay output as the "
"control signal for the camera shutter <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>` so"
" that it can be used in :ref:`Camera Missions <common-camera-control-and-"
"auto-missions-in-mission-planner>`. Additional hardware is required to "
"convert the shutter activation signal to the format expected by the "
"particular camera."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 允许您 :ref:`将舵机或继电器输出配置为相机快门的控制信号 <common-camera-shutter-with-"
"servo>`，以便在 :ref:`拍照任务 <common-camera-control-and-auto-missions-in-mission-"
"planner>` 中使用。需要额外硬件将快门触发信号转换为特定相机所需的格式。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:24
#: 0eb2872955ea4c1aba7c7e15fff2830b
msgid ""
"Farsight's `SkySight MONO <http://skysight.eu/?product=skysight-mono>`__ "
"provides everything needed to connect a Pixhawk to a supported Sony "
"MultiPort™ equipped camera in order to automate camera shutter triggering. "
"The current list of compatible cameras is on the `product page "
"<http://skysight.eu/?product=skysight-mono>`__."
msgstr ""
"Farsight 的 `SkySight MONO <http://skysight.eu/?product=skysight-mono>`__ 提供将"
" Pixhawk 连接到支持 Sony MultiPort™ 的相机所需的一切，以实现相机快门触发自动化。当前兼容相机列表见 `产品页面 "
"<http://skysight.eu/?product=skysight-mono>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:29
#: 6da00e7edb194594b2ce00c6731ae11c
msgid ""
"The board supports four camera triggering modes, allowing you to trigger the"
" shutter in single shot and burst modes, both with and without first setting"
" the autofocus. The mode used is determined by the servo PWM output set in "
"the :ref:`Camera Shutter Configuration <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>` "
"in Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"该板支持四种相机触发模式，允许您以单拍和连拍模式触发快门，支持先自动对焦或不对焦直接触发。所用模式由 Mission Planner 的 "
":ref:`相机快门配置 <common-camera-shutter-with-servo>` 中设置的舵机 PWM 输出值决定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:34
#: 9c08c111c354435ab285074c93a961c5
msgid ""
"This article provides a brief overview of how to set up the board (images "
"are reproduced courtesy of Farsight). More detailed instructions are "
"provided in the `SkySight MONO User Manual <http://skysight.eu/wp-"
"content/uploads/2015/05/MONO-User-Manual.pdf>`__."
msgstr ""
"本文简要介绍如何设置该板（图片经 Farsight 授权转载）。详细说明见 `SkySight MONO User Manual "
"<http://skysight.eu/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/MONO-User-Manual.pdf>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:39
#: 43a454c4ce3e4fde8a409b58c2e76df9
msgid "Parts and hardware connections"
msgstr "零件和硬件连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:41
#: 8094028c31f345cfa11aac8d4dc0bcbd
msgid ""
"The SkySight MONO can be `purchased from FarSight "
"<http://skysight.eu/?product=skysight-mono>`__, and comes with the cables "
"you need to connect to Pixhawk and the camera."
msgstr ""
"SkySight MONO 可从 `FarSight <http://skysight.eu/?product=skysight-mono>`__ "
"购买，附带连接 Pixhawk 和相机所需的数据线。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:47
#: 7179267f125147d49dc19f2b1ec49bb9
msgid "SkySight Mono: Board and Cables"
msgstr "SkySight Mono：板卡和数据线"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:49
#: 8086b8f820104c5dadb3e9cc5466012a
msgid ""
"Working out the correct connections is easy; the back of the board has "
"colour coded connections for the power/signal/ground, and icons to indicate "
"which connection is for the camera and which is for the servo."
msgstr "确定正确连接非常简单；板背面有颜色编码的电源/信号/地线连接，并有图标标示哪个连接器接相机、哪个接舵机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:56
#: 67790a6e47a74933b03eeb53b093111e
msgid "SykSight Mono: Board Connections"
msgstr "SykSight Mono：板卡连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:59
#: 246b7fe7479f46c9a5332cfd7912aacc
msgid "Pixhawk board"
msgstr "Pixhawk 板卡"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:61
#: 5d583e30628d42ce801a689b0e065d15
msgid ""
"Pixhawk has 6 AUX ports that may be used for triggering the camera "
"(AUX1-AUX6). These correspond to shutter options RC9-RC14 in *Mission "
"Planner*"
msgstr ""
"Pixhawk 有 6 个 AUX 端口可用于触发相机（AUX1-AUX6）。这些端口在 *Mission Planner* 中对应快门选项 "
"RC9-RC14"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:70
#: 7b7cb89bfff74a6eba2d9e3b91894b59
msgid ""
"The MONO is powered from the Pixhawk servo power rail (middle pin). Ensure "
"that the rail is :ref:`powered from a BEC <common-pixhawk-"
"overview_powering>` or provide an alternative mechanism to power the board."
msgstr ""
"MONO 由 Pixhawk 舵机电源轨（中间引脚）供电。请确保电源轨 :ref:`由 BEC 供电 <common-pixhawk-"
"overview_powering>`，或提供其他方式为板卡供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:75
#: 3937c01f2f14433eab1788da6f4c79c7
msgid "Camera shutter configuration in Mission Planner"
msgstr "Mission Planner 中的相机快门配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:77
#: 9acbe35a0dfe44628ab7c5a3a2a297c0
msgid ""
"The :ref:`Camera Shutter Configuration in Mission Planner <common-camera-"
"shutter-with-servo>` article explains how to configure Pixhawk AUX output as"
" a servo camera trigger."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Camera Shutter Configuration in Mission Planner <common-camera-"
"shutter-with-servo>` 一文介绍如何将 Pixhawk AUX 输出配置为舵机相机触发器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:80
#: f7c5634fc78743adbfad651949fb44c9
msgid "The parameters used to configure this hardware are listed below:"
msgstr "以下列出配置此硬件所用的参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:82
#: e1583c4a0920428e967ed90e955e501c
msgid "``CAM_TRIG_TYPE``: 0 (Servo)."
msgstr "``CAM_TRIG_TYPE``：0（Servo）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:84
#: 6b091aeda1f749e3a42f2263e5a4afc1
msgid ""
"``Shutter (Port)``: RC10 (for AUX2, but this will depend on your connected "
"output)."
msgstr "``Shutter (Port)``：RC10（AUX2，具体取决于您的连接输出）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:87
#: ef26158014d74875adde06165a093867
msgid "``Shutter Pushed``:"
msgstr "``Shutter Pushed``："

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:89
#: 92792e2cc93d4a0eafdc736243581303
msgid "``IS-S``: 1300 (single shot without autofocus)."
msgstr "``IS-S``：1300（无自动对焦的单拍）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:90
#: 6c78a1aa56f44d1684d639a378261bc2
msgid "``IS-B``: 1100 (burst mode without autofocus)."
msgstr "``IS-B``：1100（无自动对焦的连拍模式）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:91
#: f8e348a6cea742ae8033fd0055a643ce
msgid "``AF-S``: 1700 (autofocus 800ms then single shot)."
msgstr "``AF-S``：1700（自动对焦 800ms 后单拍）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:92
#: 285c129f32c24f5baff97f53f61b5b77
msgid "``AF-B``: 1900 (autofocus 800ms then burst mode)."
msgstr "``AF-B``：1900（自动对焦 800ms 后连拍模式）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:94
#: 2a346a19bfe14f6aabea946aa275cd50
msgid "``Shutter Not Pushed``: 1550"
msgstr "``Shutter Not Pushed``：1550"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-trigger-skysight-mono.rst:97
#: 3ecb589140474746aa3ca8ab919008a5
msgid ""
"``Shutter Duration``: 4 (4/10 seconds - this may need to be tuned for "
"specific cameras)"
msgstr "``Shutter Duration``：4（4/10 秒——可能需要针对特定相机进行调整）"

